flowchart LR
  S["a pretrained sampler<br/>CO3, ToMe, plain SDXL, PoE"]:::plain
  R["its own failure signal at steps 0 to 5<br/>attention overlap, d_t maps, blob count<br/>(for CO3 borrowing, Z2 found none<br/>of three readings predicts it)"]:::doing
  C["small checker on that signal only<br/>never sees 'cheetah' or 'cougar'"]:::plain
  G{"use it to"}:::plain
  P["push: its gradient<br/>added while sampling"]:::plain
  H["choose: set CO3's beta<br/>at each step, same trajectory"]:::plain
  L[("labels per failure kind<br/>count, co-occurrence: detector<br/>part binding: by eye only")]:::plain
  S --> R --> C --> G
  G --> P --> S
  G --> H --> S
  L -. "training data; the costly part for binding" .-> C
  classDef plain fill:#ffffff,stroke:#222222,stroke-width:2px,color:#111111
  classDef doing fill:#ffe8cc,stroke:#e8590c,stroke-width:2px
